  "createdAt": "2026-05-28T11:41:21Z",
  "description": "Dual Backup, Double Peace of Mind. Subscribe to the eufy Security Cloud Backup service if you need extra space to store event videos. Stores videos for 30 days, giving you sufficient time to review recorded videos. Videos accessible, even if devices are offline. AWS advanced encryption, ensuring data is in your control. We offer a variety of plans for you to choose the one that suits you best, up to all devices supported. To cover multiple devices, please select a service package that includes multi-device support. Repeatedly purchasing the same package will extend service only for the original device, not add additional ones.",
  "descriptionHtml": "<ul>\n<li data-line=\"true\" data-line-index=\"0\" data-zone-id=\"0\">\n<b></b>Dual Backup, Double Peace of Mind. Subscribe to the eufy Security Cloud Backup service if you need extra space to store event videos.</li>\n<li data-line=\"true\" data-line-index=\"1\" data-zone-id=\"0\">\n<b></b>Stores videos for 30 days, giving you sufficient time to review recorded videos.</li>\n<li data-line=\"true\" data-line-index=\"2\" data-zone-id=\"0\">\n<b></b>Videos accessible, even if devices are offline.</li>\n<li data-line=\"true\" data-line-index=\"3\" data-zone-id=\"0\">\n<div data-page-id=\"NVeBd9dqToTUcFxAlTPc0mphnzb\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div dir=\"auto\" class=\"richTextContainer text-align-left\">\n<span class=\"text-only\" data-eleid=\"3\"><span class=\"text-only\"><strong></strong> </span></span><span class=\"text-only\" data-eleid=\"4\"><span class=\"text-only\">AWS advanced encryption, ensuring data is in your control.</span></span>\n</div>\n</div>\n<span data-lark-record-data='{\"rootId\":\"NVeBd9dqToTUcFxAlTPc0mphnzb\",\"text\":{\"initialAttributedTexts\":{\"text\":{\"0\":\"Optimal Comfort, Maximized Output: Designed to fit all nipple sizes with flange and sizing inserts ranging from 17 mm to 24 mm. The ergonomic 105° design ensures a gentle and nurturing experience. Achieve maximum milk output with up to 290 mmHg of safe, hospital-grade suction. Customize suction strength and cycle speed to suit your unique needs. Rest assured that all skin and milk-contact components are crafted from BPA-free, food-grade materials.\"},\"attribs\":{\"0\":\"*0*1+z*0+bk\"}},\"apool\":{\"numToAttrib\":{\"0\":[\"author\",\"7212430904369823772\"],\"1\":[\"bold\",\"true\"]},\"nextNum\":2}},\"type\":\"bullet\",\"referenceRecordMap\":{},\"extra\":{\"channel\":\"saas\",\"mention_page_title\":{},\"external_mention_url\":{}},\"isKeepQuoteContainer\":false,\"isFromCode\":false,\"selection\":[{\"id\":206,\"type\":\"text\",\"selection\":{\"start\":0,\"end\":451},\"recordId\":\"PUhrdRod7o50BWxqjGNcZjYgn86\"},{\"id\":207,\"type\":\"text\",\"selection\":{\"start\":0,\"end\":0},\"recordId\":\"Th8gdiBT0oQUouxjRe5cybvLnRb\"}],\"payloadMap\":{},\"isCut\":false}' data-lark-record-format=\"docx/text\" class=\"lark-record-clipboard\"></span>\n</li>\n<li data-line=\"true\" data-line-index=\"4\" data-zone-id=\"0\">\n<b></b><meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<div dir=\"auto\" class=\"richTextContainer text-align-left\" data-partial-quote-enabled=\"true\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\"><span class=\"text-only\" data-eleid=\"3\">We offer a variety of plans for you to choose the one that suits you best, up to all devices supported.</span></div>\n</li>\n<li data-line=\"true\" data-line-index=\"4\" data-zone-id=\"0\">\n<b></b>To cover multiple devices, please select a service package that includes multi-device support. Repeatedly purchasing the same package will extend service only for the original device, not add additional ones.</li>\n</ul>",
